=Y1c8GBEax3oQ7kNvwFcP3MS&_nc_oc=AdqgmfqpepmTVt0mDY6eP96RHpQ_hxZtawwLJigbjXp3YvVuJANW_mj5aPU-Ue1TxDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPaDHozv9NxImwhRuA2IsZ2bilKIbyukSy6QZJkT-Rx2A&oe=6ADDF54A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageLandscape.png", "id": "561627380079916", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003226_561627386746582_1954839479078721397_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ltgukuPIJXkQ7kNvwFV_Tun&_nc_oc=Adp1w7IdFTQPNMfWUbbqziy_gl3uKggChal_gxwYrtvFMPnLllVEal5fYnzqrvKUBGo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPGYLOHLBeOpfcLB_WEYIkzEta-jbkiAWkEFa7KYq7QMQ&oe=6ADE0D1A"}, "display_name": "Walk the Plank", "keywords": ["Plank", "Walk", "experience", "elevator", "Heights"], "long_description": "**Your next gen plank walking simulator**, set high up in New York City, only playable on Quest 3/3S hardware, at the introductory price of just $4.99. It's the perfect experience to show off your new headset!\n{1145915837225515}\n# The Ultimate Welcome To VR\nBring friends and family together for great laughs as everyone\u2019s knees go weak on a thin plank atop the One Astor Plaza skyscraper!\n{1355526585684846}\n# Next Gen Realism\nWe set out to push the limits of what the most realistic plank simulator could be only on next gen Quest 3 and Quest 3S hardware. \n{569899162336154}\n# Plank Variety\n4 plank variations including: Wood Plank, Glass Plank, The Pole, and Red Light Green Light. More to come!\n{3774236396148078}\n# Health and Safety Warning\nAll users must refer to the in-game EULA and Safety Guidelines to limit the risk of injury or harm when walking the virtual plank.", "short_description": "Your next gen plank walking simulator, set high up in New York City, only playable on Quest 3 and 3S hardware, just $4.99. Bring family and friends together for this intense welcome to VR experience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "devel